                                                "sense_id": "294754f9-0cc2-3747-ae30-ab41fc92f9bd",
                                                "text": "The thieves got away with very little money, however—about 10 German marks, a few Czechoslovak crowns, and some 10 Belgian francs—so the share-out between four of them would be very small and disappointing."
                                            }
                                        ]
